{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38960","headline":"维扬冬末寄幕中二从事 · 杜荀鹤","name":"维扬冬末寄幕中二从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江上数株桑枣树，自从离乱更荒凉。\n那堪旅馆经残腊，祗把空书寄故乡。\n典尽客衣三尺雪，链精诗句一头霜。\n故人多在芙蓉幕，应笑孜孜道未光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38960.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38960","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}